# Protected paths (mirrors the terraform-provider-aws protected-paths gate).
# A PR touching any path below needs the owner's approval of its head and
# loses auto-merge, unless the owner below authored it; the owner-approval
# commit status stays pending until then (.github/workflows/protected-paths.yml).
# Grammar, enforced by scripts/protected-paths.sh: one rule per line,
# "/path @antonbabenko"; no wildcards. A rule covers the path itself and
# everything below it (no trailing slash, so a symlink or submodule at a
# directory path is covered too). The script matches case-insensitively.
# Most packages below do not exist yet; the rule guards them from creation.

